+# Istio integration (progressive delivery)
+
+Level 4 autonomy requires traffic shifting for canary deployments.
+
+This patch uses Istio VirtualService weighted routing.
+
+Prereqs:
+- Install Istio in cluster
+- Ensure the Aegis API service account has RBAC to create/update VirtualServices in tenant namespaces
+
+Env:
+- `AEGIS_ISTIO_VERSION=v1beta1`
+
+Notes:
+- If you prefer NGINX Ingress canary annotations or Linkerd SMI, add alternate traffic drivers in `api/golden_traffic.py`.
