+# Upgrade playbook (EKS + Aegis + Vault + Postgres)
+
+This is a starter playbook to productize upgrades.
+
+## EKS
+1) Upgrade control plane minor version.
+2) Upgrade node groups (one at a time).
+3) Upgrade cluster add-ons (CNI/CoreDNS/kube-proxy).
+
+## Vault
+1) If HA: upgrade Vault chart (rolling).
+2) Validate injector is healthy.
+3) Validate Transit is accessible.
+
+## Postgres (RDS)
+1) Snapshot
+2) Apply minor upgrade
+3) Run migrations (`alembic upgrade head`)
+
+## Aegis
+1) Deploy new container image (rolling)
+2) Run `alembic upgrade head`
+3) Validate healthz/metrics + a smoke inference
