+# Disaster recovery playbook (starter)
+
+## Objectives
+- Restore Aegis control plane and data (Postgres)
+- Restore evidence/artifacts (S3 bucket versioning + replication recommended)
+- Restore Vault keys/policies (if not using managed HSM)
+
+## Recommended infra
+- RDS multi-AZ + PITR
+- S3 versioning + cross-region replication
+- Vault HA + snapshot backup (or managed)
+
+## Drill steps (quarterly)
+1) Simulate region loss by blocking primary endpoints.
+2) Promote replica RDS in secondary region.
+3) Switch DNS to secondary ingress.
+4) Validate: auth, registry, deploy, infer, audit export.
