 # Aegis Golden Path (v1)
 
+## Level 4 autonomy patch (closed-loop controller)
+
+This patch adds:
+- Rollout policies + rollouts (DB)
+- Canary traffic shifting via Istio VirtualService weighted routing
+- A background controller loop that:
+  - steps canary weights
+  - monitors p95 latency and cost window
+  - enforces offline eval gates (eval_status + metric thresholds)
+  - auto-promotes or rolls back
+
+Endpoints:
+- POST `/v1/rollout/policies`
+- POST `/v1/rollouts`
+- POST `/v1/rollouts/{id}/rollback` (manual override)
+
+Env:
+- `AEGIS_EVAL_SCHEDULER_ENABLED=true`
+- `AEGIS_EVAL_SCHEDULER_INTERVAL_S=60`
+- `AEGIS_ISTIO_VERSION=v1beta1`
+
+Notes:
+- Controller runs in-process (v1). For production, run as a separate Deployment (controller).
+- Online error-rate is not yet included (add explicit request error counters next).
+
 ## Enterprise + Parity patch (closes remaining “platform gaps”)
